you ascend.  Or switch classes often to learn in parallel.  Both
approaches work.

> One thing I've noticed is that they keep getting weaker as time goes on.

Eating poisonous corpses cuts strength in a way that can be
cured later in the game.  Learn what monsters are only poisonous,
what ones are poisonous but can confer poison resistance, what
ones are not poisonous but can confer poison resistance.  Eat
from each grouping based on your current context.

Also going weak from nutrition abuses strength.  Resolved by
exercising strength, prayer, eating.

